{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:07.80] (Ayy, KBeaZy, you fye'd up)\n[Chorus]\n[00:17.48] In the studio all night long\n[00:18.36] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[00:19.30] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[00:22.94] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[00:24.34] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[00:26.64] In the studio all night long\n[00:27.30] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[00:28.60] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[00:29.84] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[00:31.66] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[Verse]\n[00:36.18] To all my ex's that wanna be friends\n[00:38.20] Boo-thing lame, 'cause I'm not them\n[00:40.02] You see me walkin' around in your rent\n[00:41.56] In this Burberry poncho, it look like a tent\n[00:43.40] Audemar on my wrist, I'ma ball on a bitch\n[00:45.14] Spend it all on my bitch ass (Cake)\n[00:46.96] Nah, I'm lyin', I ain't spend it all 'cause I'm rich\n[00:48.82] I be handlin' my business (Hooray)\n[00:51.42] Ayy, I love daily trips to the bank\n[00:54.02] I sit in the passenger seat while you drive, you hate when I drive and I drink\n[00:57.48] Cut one of my day one niggas off, so I wanna listen to Drake\n[01:01.12] Talkin' 'bout that Thank Me Later, how the fame'll make 'em change\n[01:04.82] I'm done doin' niggas favors\n[01:06.52] I'm just focused on collectin' paper and lovin' my baby and startin' a label\n[01:10.16] Gotta watch who you let grab a seat and a plate\n[01:11.96] They can't eat, ain't no fakes at the table\n[01:13.80] Gotta cut 'em off, give 'em the razor\n[01:15.66] It's a shock when they switch on you, taser\n[01:17.38] I wear that pain like a mask, Darth Vader\n[Chorus]\n[01:19.78] In the studio all night long\n[01:22.00] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[01:23.52] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[01:26.38] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[01:29.97] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[01:34.00] In the studio all night long\n[01:35.12] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[01:37.48] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[01:40.50] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[01:43.90] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood","words":[[7.06,7.58,"[Intro]"],[7.8,13.66,"(Ayy,"],[13.74,14.16,"KBeaZy,"],[14.2,14.24,"you"],[14.3,15.0,"fye'd"],[15.3,15.46,"up)"],[16.3,17.36,"[Chorus]"],[17.48,17.54,"In"],[17.58,17.62,"the"],[17.68,17.84,"studio"],[17.88,17.96,"all"],[18.02,18.14,"night"],[18.18,18.3,"long"],[18.36,18.44,"Want"],[18.5,18.54,"the"],[18.58,18.8,"ooh-nah-nah"],[18.84,18.96,"when"],[19.0,19.0,"I"],[19.08,19.12,"get"],[19.16,19.26,"home"],[19.3,19.32,"Oh,"],[19.38,19.6,"yeah,"],[19.64,19.74,"hold"],[19.82,19.9,"me"],[20.02,22.0,"close,"],[22.04,22.14,"you"],[22.26,22.38,"got"],[22.52,22.7,"that"],[22.76,22.9,"good"],[22.94,22.98,"You"],[23.02,23.08,"make"],[23.12,23.14,"me"],[23.18,23.26,"feel"],[23.3,23.36,"rich"],[23.4,23.46,"even"],[23.5,23.52,"if"],[23.56,23.56,"I"],[23.6,23.64,"was"],[23.68,23.76,"broke,"],[23.8,23.92,"that's"],[23.96,24.04,"all"],[24.08,24.1,"on"],[24.14,24.18,"the"],[24.22,24.3,"hood"],[24.34,24.38,"And"],[24.42,24.46,"you"],[24.5,24.7,"understand"],[24.74,24.76,"me"],[24.8,24.8,"I"],[24.84,24.92,"ain't"],[24.96,25.02,"have"],[25.06,25.08,"to"],[25.16,25.24,"show"],[25.28,25.32,"you"],[25.36,25.4,"the"],[25.44,25.56,"ropes,"],[25.6,25.64,"I'm"],[25.88,25.96,"so"],[26.1,26.6,"misunderstood"],[26.64,26.66,"In"],[26.7,26.74,"the"],[26.78,26.88,"studio"],[26.92,26.98,"all"],[27.02,27.1,"night"],[27.14,27.26,"long"],[27.3,27.38,"Want"],[27.42,27.46,"the"],[27.5,27.7,"ooh-nah-nah"],[27.74,27.88,"when"],[27.92,27.92,"I"],[27.96,28.2,"get"],[28.24,28.48,"home"],[28.6,28.64,"Oh,"],[28.7,28.8,"yeah,"],[28.9,29.04,"ho